{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>林盛斌（Bob）大女林霏兒（Faye）今年高調迎接18歲生辰，「女大十八變」的她近年因衣着性感，頻頻成為外界焦點。不過林霏兒從不受外界言論影響，更因自信態度接下品牌廣告，再度挑戰性感尺度！林盛斌已搬離九龍塘四層獨立屋，近年住到同區更大一間豪宅，林霏兒日前在社交平台分享一段在豪宅擺Pose的片段，騷出雙腿，青春迷人！</p><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒打扮成熟。(李霏兒ig)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137400912747302912704925.jpeg/i9dJUIjKuuJcrJyxjvXLWhpodIuBJujZ6kV8_upFfP4\"/><figcaption>林霏兒打扮成熟。(李霏兒ig)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌與大女林霏兒。（IG@bob_lamshingbun）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137407795201970176981306.jpeg/RB0YRQCqoz8TcAMoaZPC2igrlLn1xiygEKBmeBCgZng\"/><figcaption>林盛斌與大女林霏兒。（IG@bob_lamshingbun）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌攜同太太黃乙頤、長女林霏兒（左一）、次女林熹兒（左三）、三女林機兒（左二）及幼子林道申一同在《史迪仔》首映上接受傳媒訪問。（莫匡堯　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137407792962080768496250.jpeg/3Oe9sMeNh-FiaVvMRcHcrhFESaIl9Dy5GS2srhktrK4\"/><figcaption>林盛斌攜同太太黃乙頤、長女林霏兒（左一）、次女林熹兒（左三）、三女林機兒（左二）及幼子林道申一同在《史迪仔》首映上接受傳媒訪問。（莫匡堯　攝）</figcaption></figure><p>林霏兒豪宅落地窗擺Pose極青春</p><p>林霏兒在社交平台分享片段。從片段中可見，林霏兒身處豪宅落地玻璃窗前，在家中擺Pose。她穿上寬鬆上衣，孭上一個青春感十足的粉紅色手袋仔，以及穿上超短褲，騷出雙腿，在窗前撥弄頭髮，擺出各種迷人Pose。最後她蹦蹦跳跳地走回到鏡頭前，看來心情大靚。她發文：「latingirl養成記」，網民都讚她可愛又明媚。</p><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒在豪宅。（抖音@faye霏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157107803006308352097436.png/y_XDPVE5L31TPr0bPBRmsf5Mj3Kndy-cRSU3ckUlN3I\"/><figcaption>林霏兒在豪宅。（抖音@faye霏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺出各種Pose。（抖音@faye霏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157107800619618304613897.png/HZ2TdKeGDWzEdSO4GiJRqM0-YhplsROv2McgQdjHIEE\"/><figcaption>擺出各種Pose。（抖音@faye霏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青春可愛！（抖音@faye霏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157107798308425728613794.png/w4jmzE2L-HnbOl2eOWmM-Uv5iUdOA2Kw7MP-h-zD_oc\"/><figcaption>青春可愛！（抖音@faye霏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"心情大靚！（抖音@faye霏）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260723/1157107795829460992430965.png/W-XomWDXM7PawCjWcdeigSELLmhAAi8iaQ8mWWkPJlk\"/><figcaption>心情大靚！（抖音@faye霏）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌大女兒不時上貼性感照。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251024/1058380021061652480967142.jpeg/BJVafiCENUTDyhodQmSCRhb9nbZCVZNxJedHlyXnR5c\"/><figcaption>林盛斌大女兒不時上貼性感照。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青春！（IG@ fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251026/1059202431864410112325614.jpeg/jYSOXxOI2Yty3k9D4gJXdpY_5gX3etXyoCfplKAn6ZQ\"/><figcaption>青春！（IG@ fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林盛斌女兒Faye曬低胸慶生照。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138157107820892160469280.jpeg/WHpc4flqmNH06uqrm6QDVTY86gdU3gwTUkY3CFJGNwg\"/><figcaption>林盛斌女兒Faye曬低胸慶生照。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Faye女大十八變。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138157290298281984795183.jpeg/1VIEu1cNeb1QfB4S_WlBGuCtpQlSKle6OovskTqL7JE\"/><figcaption>Faye女大十八變。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Faye女大十八變。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138157354550824960974528.jpeg/l_l71IZ3r5gPUAGZNC9JSwjK7ApBlKdLbDKkYWwypGE\"/><figcaption>Faye女大十八變。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"另一個造型。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574823869091840160437.png/spiiN9sH_1zXR5IMELf8Ir8DYO6VupvF7yFh1e8hYdU\"/><figcaption>另一個造型。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Bob 18歲大女着Deep V短裙。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574829166759936391704.png/xLiHAEexv6oPKzSDEQ2zLvvOh4OKQcZpp7Hp7aex6e0\"/><figcaption>Bob 18歲大女着Deep V短裙。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260708/1151574829015633920731092.png/wMBKlLAb8_Y-N98L5Gs5lPi1mKQw_GBxUJbW4VCW1uE\"/><figcaption>林霏兒不怕鏡頭。（IG@fayelammm）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at